   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive)<br>\n<strong>Type:</strong> Neuralware<br>\n<strong>Install:</strong> Clinic<br>\n<strong>Humanity Loss:</strong> 14 (4d6)<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> uses 1</p>\n<p>Speedware. Activating it takes an Action and it runs for 60 seconds (20 Rounds). While active it gives +3 to any initiative roll; if activated while already in an initiative queue, current initiative goes up by 3, which is lost if the cyberware switches off or the duration ends during combat. 1 hour cooldown. Only one piece of Speedware can be installed at a time.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Replaces the core system's Sandevistan; use this one instead of the core item.</li>\n<li>Matches the core item's setup: the +3 shows as a toggle in the initiative roll dialog.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Neuralware).</em></p>"
